Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: register the SM-G955N internal speaker PCM

Connect the proven RDMA0/SIFS1/UAIF4 playback route and the MAX98506
amplifier. Use the native ABOX DMA translation, restrict the trial
to 48 kHz S16 stereo and stop the DMA before releasing its ring.

diff --git a/sound/soc/samsung/Kconfig b/sound/soc/samsung/Kconfig
--- a/sound/soc/samsung/Kconfig
+++ b/sound/soc/samsung/Kconfig
@@ -149,3 +149,9 @@
 	  Say Y if you want to add support for SoC audio on the Midas boards.
 
 endif #SND_SOC_SAMSUNG
+
+config SND_SOC_G955N_ABOX_SPEAKER
+	tristate "Galaxy S8+ native ABOX loudspeaker PCM"
+	depends on ARCH_EXYNOS && EXYNOS_IOMMU && IOMMU_DMA
+	help
+	  Register the SM-G955N MAX98506 loudspeaker and its ABOX PCM.
